    "STATIC 3D tilt around the X axis (degrees) applied after 4D perspective.": "在 4D 透視後，依 X 軸（度數）進行靜態 3D 傾斜。",
    "STATIC 3D tilt around the X axis (degrees) applied after 4D perspective. Use the gizmo to set the viewing angle.": "在 4D 透視後，依 X 軸（度數）進行靜態 3D 傾斜。用這個裝置來設定視角。",
    "STATIC 3D tilt around the X axis (degrees) applied after 4D perspective. Use the rotation gizmo to set the viewing angle.": "在 4D 透視後，依 X 軸（度數）進行靜態 3D 傾斜。用旋轉裝置設定視角。",
    "STATIC 3D tilt around the Y axis (degrees).": "靜態三維傾斜，繞 Y 軸（度數）。",
    "STATIC 3D tilt around the Z axis (degrees).": "靜態三維傾斜，繞 Z 軸（度數）。",
    "STATIC rotation in the screen plane (degrees).": "螢幕平面上的靜態旋轉（度數）。",
    "STATIC tilt around the X axis (degrees). 23° matches Earth's axial tilt. Applied before rotation.": "靜態傾斜，繞 X 軸（度數）。23°與地球的軸傾角相符。輪換前就已經塗上了。",
    "STATIC tilt around the X axis (degrees). Applied before rotation cycles. Use to set the initial orientation of the shape.": "靜態傾斜，繞 X 軸（度數）。在旋轉週期前施用。用來設定形狀的初始方向。",
    "STATIC tilt around the X axis (degrees). Tumbles the symbol forward/back.": "靜態傾斜，繞 X 軸（度數）。符號前後翻滾。",
    "STATIC tilt around the Y axis (degrees). Changes where the texture's \"front\" faces.": "靜態傾斜，繞 Y 軸（度數）。改變材質「正面」的方向。",
    "STATIC tilt around the Y axis (degrees). Spins the symbol like a coin face-on/face-away.": "靜態傾斜，繞 Y 軸（度數）。像硬幣一樣旋轉符號，正面或背面。",
    "STATIC tilt around the Y axis (degrees). Use to face a different side of the shape forward.": "靜態傾斜，繞 Y 軸（度數）。用來面向形狀的另一側。",
    "STATIC tilt around the Z axis (degrees). Leans the sphere left/right.": "靜態傾斜繞Z軸（度數）。球體向左或向右傾斜。",
