    "Strength of the specular highlight crescents + caustic glow. 0 = matte, 1 = glossy wet.": "鏡面高光強度：新月形+腐蝕性光暈。0 = 霧面，1 = 光澤濕潤。",
    "Strength of the texture overlay on the flame. 0 = base colors only. Only relevant when a Texture is set.": "火焰表面覆蓋的質地強度。0 = 僅底色。只有在材質設定時才會相關。",
