    "The $ symbol — S-curve with a vertical bar through it. Full 3D rotation.": "$符號 — 帶有一條垂直橫條的S形曲線。完整的3D旋轉。",
    "The Soviet emblem — a sickle blade crossed by a hammer. Geometry ported from the canonical flag SVG. Full 3D rotation.": "蘇聯徽章——一把鐮刀刀刃交叉，上面有錘子。幾何圖形是從經典旗幟 SVG 移植而來。完整的3D旋轉。",
    "The current map could not be saved.": "目前的地圖無法被保存。",
    "The map could not be saved.": "地圖無法被保存。",
    "The map could not be saved. The current view will remain open.": "地圖無法被保存。目前的觀點將保持開放。",
    "The map list could not be saved.": "地圖清單無法儲存。",
    "The new map file could not be saved.": "新的地圖檔案無法儲存。",
    "The previous RPG Maker runtime was archived to": "先前的 RPG Maker 執行環境被歸檔為",
    "The project database could not be loaded. Check the JSON files for parse errors.": "專案資料庫無法載入。檢查 JSON 檔案是否有解析錯誤。",
    "The project metadata or map list could not be saved.": "專案的元資料或地圖清單無法儲存。",
    "The taijitu — a disc divided by an S-curve into two interlocking teardrops with opposite-colored dots in each. Full 3D rotation.": "太極圖——一個由S形曲線分成兩個互鎖淚滴，每個淚滴中有相反顏色的點。完整的3D旋轉。",
    "The ¥ symbol — Y diagonals + vertical descender + two crossbars. Full 3D rotation.": "¥符號 — Y對角線+垂直下降線+兩個橫桿。完整的3D旋轉。",
    "The € symbol — C-arc with two horizontal bars. Full 3D rotation.": "€符號 — 帶有兩條橫條的C弧。完整的3D旋轉。",
    "There are unsaved changes in": "有未儲存的變更",
    "There is already an event at this position.": "這個位置已經有活動了。",
    "Thickness multiplier of each ripple ring.": "每個漣漪環的厚度倍增器。",
    "Thickness of the bright disk around the horizon (fraction of event radius). 0 = no disk.": "地平線周圍明亮圓盤的厚度（佔事件半徑的比例）。0 = 無磁碟。",
    "This command has no parameters.": "此指令沒有參數。",
    "This entry can be removed and saved.": "此條目可移除並保存。",
    "This is a single-character sheet.": "這是一張單一角色卡。",
    "This moves the RPG Maker corescript, js/libs, and index.html into rpgmaker-runtime-backup.zip in the project folder, then installs the Reactor engine files (reactor_*.js and js/libs) in their place.": "這會將 RPG Maker 的 corescript、js/libs 和 index.html 移到 project 資料夾的 rpgmaker-runtime-backup.zip，然後安裝 Reactor 引擎檔案（reactor_*.js 和 js/libs）來取代它們。",
    "This plugin file carries no parameter annotations, so its saved values are shown as plain fields. Labels, descriptions and pickers are unavailable; the values themselves are correct and editable.": "這個外掛檔案沒有參數註解，因此以純欄位顯示已儲存的值。標籤、說明與選擇器無法使用；但值本身是正確的，也可以編輯。",
    "This plugin has no configurable parameters.": "這個外掛沒有可設定的參數。",
    "This project is already open in another RPG Reactor instance.": "這個專案已經在另一個 RPG Reactor 實例中開啟了。",
    "This removes its": "這會移除其",
    "This removes their Map###.json files and MapInfos entries.": "這會移除他們的Map###.json檔案和 MapInfos 條目。",
    "This updates the engine files (reactor_*.js and js/libs) to this editor's versions. Your plugin manifest and game data are untouched.": "此功能會更新引擎檔案（reactor_*.js 和 js/libs）至此編輯器的版本。你的插件清單和遊戲資料都沒動過。",
