    "A swirling tornado/vortex with helical strands wrapping a funnel shape. Tune top/base radius and twists for everything from a dust devil to a healing whirlwind.": "一个旋转的龙卷风/漩涡，螺旋丝缠绕着漏斗形状。调整顶部/底部的半径和扭转，适合从尘暴到治疗旋风的各种武器。",
