    "Full 3x4 sheet detected. Paste this into a style body file such as {path}. The renderer uses A-Z material letters; hand-clean any pixels where color-only quantizing picked the wrong material.": "检测到完整的3x4板。把它粘贴到风格正体文件，比如 {path}。渲染器使用A-Z的材料字母;手动清理任何纯色量化选错材料的像素。",
