    "Glowing orb of energy (Spirit Bomb, ki sphere, plasma ball). Multi-layer halo + core, surface lightning arcs, orbiting sparkles, optional radial rays.": "发光能量球（灵弹、气球、等离子球）。多层光环+核心，表面闪电弧，轨道闪光，可选径向射线。",
