    "Spherical force-field bubble around its center. Energy wisps are great-circle arcs distributed evenly across the sphere surface, with silhouette-weighted alpha so the bubble outline reads brightest at the rim (fresnel-edged). Use it as a shield/aura around a character or object.": "中心周围有球形力场气泡。能量光线是均匀分布在球面的大圆弧，带有轮廓加权的α，使气泡轮廓在边缘（菲涅尔边缘）最明亮。用它作为护盾/光环包围角色或物体。",
    "Spread of brightness between dark and bright pixels. 0 = flat mid-grey; 1 = full black-to-white range.": "亮度在暗与亮像素之间的分布。0 = 平坦的中灰色;1 = 完整的黑白范围。",
