    "This plugin file carries no parameter annotations, so its saved values are shown as plain fields. Labels, descriptions and pickers are unavailable; the values themselves are correct and editable.": "这个插件文件没有参数注解，因此以纯字段显示已保存的值。标签、说明和选择器不可用；但值本身是正确的，也可以编辑。",
