    "Vertical center of the horizontal arm. 0 = centered (Greek cross); 0.3 = upper third (Latin).": "水平臂的垂直中心。0 = 居中（希腊十字）;0.3 = 上三分之一（拉丁语）。",
    "Vertical center of the shape (fraction of frame height). 0 = top, 0.5 = center, 1 = bottom.": "形状的垂直中心（相框高度的比例）。0 = 上方，0.5 = 中心，1 = 下方。",
    "Vertical cycles each particle completes per loop. Integer for seamless looping.": "垂直循环：每个粒子在每个环路完成。整数用于无缝循环。",
    "Vertical extent of the column (column height as a fraction of size). 1.0 = column-as-tall-as-wide, 1.6 = taller transporter pad.": "柱的垂直范围（柱高以尺寸的比例表示）。1.0 = 柱高与宽相同，1.6 = 更高的运输垫。",
    "Vertical extent of the tornado (fraction of frame height).": "龙卷风的垂直范围（占画面高度的比例）。",
    "Vertical extent of the waveform within its zone. 0 = flatline.": "波形在其区域内的垂直范围。0 = 平线。",
    "Vertical extent of where drops spawn (fraction of frame height). 0 = all on a horizontal line.": "掉落生成的垂直范围（占帧高度的比例）。0 = 所有在水平线上。",
    "Vertical position (fraction of frame height). 0 = top, 0.5 = center, 1 = bottom.": "垂直位置（画面高度的分数）。0 = 上方，0.5 = 中心，1 = 下方。",
    "Vertical position of the 4-point star (USSF default: -0.28, in the lower interior). Negative = lower, positive = upper.": "四角星的垂直位置（USSF默认：-0.28，位于下方内部）。负值=下层，正值=上方。",
    "Vertical position of the flame base (0 = top of frame, 1 = bottom). Default 0.8 puts the base near the bottom edge.": "火焰底座的垂直位置（0 = 画面顶部，1 = 底部）。默认的0.8会把底座放在底部边缘附近。",
    "Vertical position of the ring (above triangle apex, ≈0.81 by default).": "环的垂直位置（三角形顶点上方，≈默认为0.81）。",
    "Vertical reach of each waveform. 0.2 = flat, 1.5 = clipping into neighbor row.": "每个波形的垂直范围。0.2 = 平坦，1.5 = 削波到邻居行。",
    "Vertical scale of the helix. 1 = unit cube (default), 0.3 = squat, 2-3 = tall and stretched.": "螺旋的垂直比例。1 = 单位立方体（默认），0.3 = 深蹲，2-3 = 高大且拉伸。",
