  "id": {"A structure named “{name}” already exists. Replace it?": "Bangunan bernama “{name}” sudah ada. Ganti?", "Bring the events inside as its people": "Sertakan acara di dalamnya sebagai penghuninya", "Double-click a piece to do the same.": "Klik ganda pada bagian melakukan hal yang sama.", "Give it a name.": "Beri nama.", "It then moves and turns as one, and Rebuild from plan updates it.": "Setelah itu ia bergerak dan berputar sebagai satu kesatuan, dan Bangun ulang dari denah memperbaruinya.", "Make the selection one building of it": "Jadikan pilihan satu bangunan darinya", "New structure": "Bangunan baru", "Reuse it anywhere from the Blueprint slot.": "Pakai lagi di mana saja dari slot Cetak biru.", "Save as structure": "Simpan sebagai bangunan", "Save as structure…": "Simpan sebagai bangunan…", "Saved as a structure: {name}": "Disimpan sebagai bangunan: {name}", "Select whole building": "Pilih seluruh bangunan", "{w} × {d} cells": "{w} × {d} sel", "{count} pieces": "{count} bagian", "{count} lights": "{count} lampu", "{count} models": "{count} model", "{count} screens": "{count} layar", "{count} water areas": "{count} area air"},
