// Action sequences, 2026-10-03: the preview turns on a drag of empty space, and a pose step moves the weapon in the hand.
for (const [locale, phrases] of Object.entries({
  "ja": {"Drag empty space to turn the view; drag a gizmo or a battler to move it. Shift-drag or middle-drag pans, scroll zooms.": "何もない場所をドラッグすると視点が回転し、ギズモやバトラーをドラッグすると移動します。Shift+ドラッグまたは中ボタンドラッグでパン、スクロールでズームします。", "Moves the weapon in the hand while this pose is reached. Click the weapon in the preview to drag it.": "このポーズに達する間に、手の中の武器を動かします。プレビューで武器をクリックするとドラッグできます。"},
  "es": {"Drag empty space to turn the view; drag a gizmo or a battler to move it. Shift-drag or middle-drag pans, scroll zooms.": "Arrastra el espacio vacío para girar la vista; arrastra un gizmo o un combatiente para moverlo. Mayús+arrastrar o arrastrar con el botón central desplaza; la rueda acerca y aleja.", "Moves the weapon in the hand while this pose is reached. Click the weapon in the preview to drag it.": "Mueve el arma en la mano mientras se alcanza esta pose. Haz clic en el arma en la vista previa para arrastrarla."},
  "zh-Hant": {"Drag empty space to turn the view; drag a gizmo or a battler to move it. Shift-drag or middle-drag pans, scroll zooms.": "拖曳空白處可旋轉視角；拖曳控制器或戰鬥者可移動它。Shift+拖曳或中鍵拖曳可平移，滾輪縮放。", "Moves the weapon in the hand while this pose is reached. Click the weapon in the preview to drag it.": "在達到此姿勢的同時移動手中的武器。在預覽中點擊武器即可拖曳。"},
  "zh-Hans": {"Drag empty space to turn the view; drag a gizmo or a battler to move it. Shift-drag or middle-drag pans, scroll zooms.": "拖动空白处可旋转视角；拖动控制器或战斗者可移动它。Shift+拖动或中键拖动可平移，滚轮缩放。", "Moves the weapon in the hand while this pose is reached. Click the weapon in the preview to drag it.": "在达到此姿势的同时移动手中的武器。在预览中点击武器即可拖动。"},
  "ru": {"Drag empty space to turn the view; drag a gizmo or a battler to move it. Shift-drag or middle-drag pans, scroll zooms.": "Перетащите пустое место, чтобы повернуть вид; перетащите манипулятор или бойца, чтобы переместить его. Shift+перетаскивание или средняя кнопка сдвигают вид, колесо масштабирует.", "Moves the weapon in the hand while this pose is reached. Click the weapon in the preview to drag it.": "Перемещает оружие в руке, пока принимается эта поза. Щёлкните оружие в предпросмотре, чтобы перетащить его."},
  "pt": {"Drag empty space to turn the view; drag a gizmo or a battler to move it. Shift-drag or middle-drag pans, scroll zooms.": "Arraste o espaço vazio para girar a vista; arraste um gizmo ou um combatente para movê-lo. Shift+arrastar ou arrastar com o botão do meio desloca; a roda aplica zoom.", "Moves the weapon in the hand while this pose is reached. Click the weapon in the preview to drag it.": "Move a arma na mão enquanto esta pose é alcançada. Clique na arma na prévia para arrastá-la."},
  "de": {"Drag empty space to turn the view; drag a gizmo or a battler to move it. Shift-drag or middle-drag pans, scroll zooms.": "Leeren Bereich ziehen, um die Ansicht zu drehen; ein Gizmo oder einen Kämpfer ziehen, um ihn zu bewegen. Umschalt+Ziehen oder Ziehen mit der mittleren Taste verschiebt, das Mausrad zoomt.", "Moves the weapon in the hand while this pose is reached. Click the weapon in the preview to drag it.": "Bewegt die Waffe in der Hand, während diese Pose eingenommen wird. Klicke in der Vorschau auf die Waffe, um sie zu ziehen."},
  "fr": {"Drag empty space to turn the view; drag a gizmo or a battler to move it. Shift-drag or middle-drag pans, scroll zooms.": "Faites glisser l'espace vide pour tourner la vue ; faites glisser un gizmo ou un combattant pour le déplacer. Maj+glisser ou glisser avec le bouton du milieu déplace la vue, la molette zoome.", "Moves the weapon in the hand while this pose is reached. Click the weapon in the preview to drag it.": "Déplace l'arme dans la main pendant que cette pose est prise. Cliquez sur l'arme dans l'aperçu pour la faire glisser."},
  "el": {"Drag empty space to turn the view; drag a gizmo or a battler to move it. Shift-drag or middle-drag pans, scroll zooms.": "Σύρετε τον κενό χώρο για να γυρίσετε την προβολή· σύρετε ένα gizmo ή έναν μαχητή για να τον μετακινήσετε. Shift+σύρσιμο ή σύρσιμο με το μεσαίο κουμπί μετατοπίζει, η ροδέλα κάνει ζουμ.", "Moves the weapon in the hand while this pose is reached. Click the weapon in the preview to drag it.": "Μετακινεί το όπλο στο χέρι όσο λαμβάνεται αυτή η πόζα. Κάντε κλικ στο όπλο στην προεπισκόπηση για να το σύρετε."},
  "ko": {"Drag empty space to turn the view; drag a gizmo or a battler to move it. Shift-drag or middle-drag pans, scroll zooms.": "빈 공간을 드래그하면 시점이 회전하고, 기즈모나 배틀러를 드래그하면 이동합니다. Shift+드래그 또는 가운데 버튼 드래그로 이동하고, 스크롤로 확대/축소합니다.", "Moves the weapon in the hand while this pose is reached. Click the weapon in the preview to drag it.": "이 포즈에 도달하는 동안 손에 든 무기를 움직입니다. 미리보기에서 무기를 클릭하면 드래그할 수 있습니다."},
  "ar": {"Drag empty space to turn the view; drag a gizmo or a battler to move it. Shift-drag or middle-drag pans, scroll zooms.": "اسحب المساحة الفارغة لتدوير العرض؛ اسحب أداة التحكم أو المقاتل لتحريكه. Shift+سحب أو السحب بالزر الأوسط يحرّك العرض، والتمرير يكبّر ويصغّر.", "Moves the weapon in the hand while this pose is reached. Click the weapon in the preview to drag it.": "يحرّك السلاح في اليد أثناء الوصول إلى هذه الوضعية. انقر على السلاح في المعاينة لسحبه."},
  "it": {"Drag empty space to turn the view; drag a gizmo or a battler to move it. Shift-drag or middle-drag pans, scroll zooms.": "Trascina lo spazio vuoto per ruotare la vista; trascina un gizmo o un combattente per spostarlo. Maiusc+trascina o trascina con il tasto centrale sposta la vista, la rotellina esegue lo zoom.", "Moves the weapon in the hand while this pose is reached. Click the weapon in the preview to drag it.": "Sposta l'arma nella mano mentre si raggiunge questa posa. Fai clic sull'arma nell'anteprima per trascinarla."},
  "pl": {"Drag empty space to turn the view; drag a gizmo or a battler to move it. Shift-drag or middle-drag pans, scroll zooms.": "Przeciągnij puste miejsce, aby obrócić widok; przeciągnij uchwyt lub walczącego, aby go przesunąć. Shift+przeciąganie lub przeciąganie środkowym przyciskiem przesuwa widok, kółko przybliża.", "Moves the weapon in the hand while this pose is reached. Click the weapon in the preview to drag it.": "Przesuwa broń w dłoni podczas przyjmowania tej pozy. Kliknij broń w podglądzie, aby ją przeciągnąć."},
  "id": {"Drag empty space to turn the view; drag a gizmo or a battler to move it. Shift-drag or middle-drag pans, scroll zooms.": "Seret ruang kosong untuk memutar tampilan; seret gizmo atau petarung untuk memindahkannya. Shift+seret atau seret tombol tengah menggeser, gulir memperbesar.", "Moves the weapon in the hand while this pose is reached. Click the weapon in the preview to drag it.": "Menggerakkan senjata di tangan saat pose ini dicapai. Klik senjata di pratinjau untuk menyeretnya."},
  "vi": {"Drag empty space to turn the view; drag a gizmo or a battler to move it. Shift-drag or middle-drag pans, scroll zooms.": "Kéo vùng trống để xoay góc nhìn; kéo gizmo hoặc chiến binh để di chuyển. Shift+kéo hoặc kéo nút giữa để dời khung nhìn, cuộn để thu phóng.", "Moves the weapon in the hand while this pose is reached. Click the weapon in the preview to drag it.": "Di chuyển vũ khí trong tay trong khi đạt tới tư thế này. Nhấp vào vũ khí trong bản xem trước để kéo."},
  "th": {"Drag empty space to turn the view; drag a gizmo or a battler to move it. Shift-drag or middle-drag pans, scroll zooms.": "ลากพื้นที่ว่างเพื่อหมุนมุมมอง ลากกิซโมหรือตัวละครต่อสู้เพื่อย้าย Shift+ลากหรือลากปุ่มกลางเพื่อเลื่อน เลื่อนล้อเพื่อซูม", "Moves the weapon in the hand while this pose is reached. Click the weapon in the preview to drag it.": "ขยับอาวุธในมือขณะเข้าสู่ท่านี้ คลิกอาวุธในพรีวิวเพื่อลาก"},
  "tr": {"Drag empty space to turn the view; drag a gizmo or a battler to move it. Shift-drag or middle-drag pans, scroll zooms.": "Görünümü döndürmek için boş alanı sürükleyin; taşımak için bir gizmoyu veya savaşçıyı sürükleyin. Shift+sürükleme veya orta düğmeyle sürükleme kaydırır, tekerlek yakınlaştırır.", "Moves the weapon in the hand while this pose is reached. Click the weapon in the preview to drag it.": "Bu poza ulaşılırken eldeki silahı hareket ettirir. Sürüklemek için önizlemede silaha tıklayın."}
})) Object.assign(globalThis.RR_DEEP_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS[locale] || (globalThis.RR_DEEP_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS[locale] = {}), phrases);

// The mouth's outline in Face points, 2026-10-03: the ring's corner names and how it is dragged.
for (const [locale, phrases] of Object.entries({
  "ja": {"Left corner": "左の口角", "Right corner": "右の口角", "Drag the markers onto the lips; the two sides mirror (hold Alt to move one side). Drag the middle dot to move the whole mouth, Shift-drag a marker to resize it.": "マーカーを唇の上にドラッグします。左右は対称に動きます（Alt を押すと片側だけ動かせます）。中央の点をドラッグすると口全体が移動し、Shift を押しながらマーカーをドラッグすると大きさが変わります。"},
  "es": {"Left corner": "Comisura izquierda", "Right corner": "Comisura derecha", "Drag the markers onto the lips; the two sides mirror (hold Alt to move one side). Drag the middle dot to move the whole mouth, Shift-drag a marker to resize it.": "Arrastra los marcadores sobre los labios; los dos lados se reflejan (mantén Alt para mover un solo lado). Arrastra el punto central para mover toda la boca y arrastra un marcador con Mayús para cambiar su tamaño."},
  "zh-Hant": {"Left corner": "左嘴角", "Right corner": "右嘴角", "Drag the markers onto the lips; the two sides mirror (hold Alt to move one side). Drag the middle dot to move the whole mouth, Shift-drag a marker to resize it.": "將標記拖曳到嘴唇上；左右兩側會互相鏡像（按住 Alt 可只移動一側）。拖曳中間的點可移動整個嘴巴，按住 Shift 拖曳標記可調整大小。"},
  "zh-Hans": {"Left corner": "左嘴角", "Right corner": "右嘴角", "Drag the markers onto the lips; the two sides mirror (hold Alt to move one side). Drag the middle dot to move the whole mouth, Shift-drag a marker to resize it.": "将标记拖到嘴唇上；左右两侧会互相镜像（按住 Alt 可只移动一侧）。拖动中间的点可移动整个嘴巴，按住 Shift 拖动标记可调整大小。"},
  "ru": {"Left corner": "Левый уголок", "Right corner": "Правый уголок", "Drag the markers onto the lips; the two sides mirror (hold Alt to move one side). Drag the middle dot to move the whole mouth, Shift-drag a marker to resize it.": "Перетащите маркеры на губы; стороны зеркалят друг друга (удерживайте Alt, чтобы двигать одну сторону). Перетащите среднюю точку, чтобы переместить весь рот, а с Shift перетащите маркер, чтобы изменить его размер."},
  "pt": {"Left corner": "Canto esquerdo", "Right corner": "Canto direito", "Drag the markers onto the lips; the two sides mirror (hold Alt to move one side). Drag the middle dot to move the whole mouth, Shift-drag a marker to resize it.": "Arraste os marcadores para os lábios; os dois lados se espelham (segure Alt para mover um lado só). Arraste o ponto do meio para mover a boca inteira e arraste um marcador com Shift para redimensioná-la."},
  "de": {"Left corner": "Linker Mundwinkel", "Right corner": "Rechter Mundwinkel", "Drag the markers onto the lips; the two sides mirror (hold Alt to move one side). Drag the middle dot to move the whole mouth, Shift-drag a marker to resize it.": "Ziehe die Marker auf die Lippen; beide Seiten spiegeln sich (Alt halten, um nur eine Seite zu bewegen). Ziehe den mittleren Punkt, um den ganzen Mund zu verschieben, und ziehe einen Marker mit Umschalt, um die Größe zu ändern."},
  "fr": {"Left corner": "Coin gauche", "Right corner": "Coin droit", "Drag the markers onto the lips; the two sides mirror (hold Alt to move one side). Drag the middle dot to move the whole mouth, Shift-drag a marker to resize it.": "Faites glisser les marqueurs sur les lèvres ; les deux côtés se reflètent (maintenez Alt pour déplacer un seul côté). Faites glisser le point central pour déplacer toute la bouche, et un marqueur avec Maj pour la redimensionner."},
  "el": {"Left corner": "Αριστερή γωνία", "Right corner": "Δεξιά γωνία", "Drag the markers onto the lips; the two sides mirror (hold Alt to move one side). Drag the middle dot to move the whole mouth, Shift-drag a marker to resize it.": "Σύρετε τους δείκτες πάνω στα χείλη· οι δύο πλευρές καθρεφτίζονται (κρατήστε Alt για να μετακινήσετε μόνο τη μία). Σύρετε τη μεσαία κουκκίδα για να μετακινήσετε ολόκληρο το στόμα και σύρετε έναν δείκτη με Shift για να αλλάξετε το μέγεθός του."},
  "ko": {"Left corner": "왼쪽 입꼬리", "Right corner": "오른쪽 입꼬리", "Drag the markers onto the lips; the two sides mirror (hold Alt to move one side). Drag the middle dot to move the whole mouth, Shift-drag a marker to resize it.": "마커를 입술 위로 드래그하세요. 양쪽은 서로 대칭으로 움직입니다(Alt를 누르면 한쪽만 움직입니다). 가운데 점을 드래그하면 입 전체가 이동하고, Shift를 누른 채 마커를 드래그하면 크기가 바뀝니다."},
  "ar": {"Left corner": "الزاوية اليسرى", "Right corner": "الزاوية اليمنى", "Drag the markers onto the lips; the two sides mirror (hold Alt to move one side). Drag the middle dot to move the whole mouth, Shift-drag a marker to resize it.": "اسحب العلامات إلى الشفتين؛ الجانبان متناظران (اضغط Alt لتحريك جانب واحد). اسحب النقطة الوسطى لتحريك الفم كله، واسحب علامة مع Shift لتغيير حجمه."},
  "it": {"Left corner": "Angolo sinistro", "Right corner": "Angolo destro", "Drag the markers onto the lips; the two sides mirror (hold Alt to move one side). Drag the middle dot to move the whole mouth, Shift-drag a marker to resize it.": "Trascina i marcatori sulle labbra; i due lati si rispecchiano (tieni premuto Alt per muovere un solo lato). Trascina il punto centrale per spostare tutta la bocca e trascina un marcatore con Maiusc per ridimensionarla."},
  "pl": {"Left corner": "Lewy kącik", "Right corner": "Prawy kącik", "Drag the markers onto the lips; the two sides mirror (hold Alt to move one side). Drag the middle dot to move the whole mouth, Shift-drag a marker to resize it.": "Przeciągnij znaczniki na usta; obie strony są lustrzane (przytrzymaj Alt, aby przesunąć jedną stronę). Przeciągnij środkowy punkt, aby przesunąć całe usta, a z Shiftem przeciągnij znacznik, aby zmienić ich rozmiar."},
  "id": {"Left corner": "Sudut kiri", "Right corner": "Sudut kanan", "Drag the markers onto the lips; the two sides mirror (hold Alt to move one side). Drag the middle dot to move the whole mouth, Shift-drag a marker to resize it.": "Seret penanda ke bibir; kedua sisi saling mencerminkan (tahan Alt untuk menggerakkan satu sisi saja). Seret titik tengah untuk memindahkan seluruh mulut, dan Shift+seret penanda untuk mengubah ukurannya."},
  "vi": {"Left corner": "Khóe trái", "Right corner": "Khóe phải", "Drag the markers onto the lips; the two sides mirror (hold Alt to move one side). Drag the middle dot to move the whole mouth, Shift-drag a marker to resize it.": "Kéo các điểm đánh dấu lên môi; hai bên đối xứng nhau (giữ Alt để chỉ di chuyển một bên). Kéo điểm giữa để di chuyển cả miệng, giữ Shift và kéo một điểm để đổi kích thước."},
  "th": {"Left corner": "มุมซ้าย", "Right corner": "มุมขวา", "Drag the markers onto the lips; the two sides mirror (hold Alt to move one side). Drag the middle dot to move the whole mouth, Shift-drag a marker to resize it.": "ลากจุดมาร์กเกอร์ไปวางบนริมฝีปาก สองข้างจะสะท้อนกัน (กด Alt ค้างเพื่อขยับข้างเดียว) ลากจุดตรงกลางเพื่อย้ายปากทั้งหมด และกด Shift แล้วลากมาร์กเกอร์เพื่อปรับขนาด"},
  "tr": {"Left corner": "Sol köşe", "Right corner": "Sağ köşe", "Drag the markers onto the lips; the two sides mirror (hold Alt to move one side). Drag the middle dot to move the whole mouth, Shift-drag a marker to resize it.": "İşaretçileri dudakların üzerine sürükleyin; iki taraf birbirini yansıtır (tek tarafı oynatmak için Alt'ı basılı tutun). Tüm ağzı taşımak için ortadaki noktayı sürükleyin, boyutunu değiştirmek için bir işaretçiyi Shift ile sürükleyin."}
})) Object.assign(globalThis.RR_DEEP_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS[locale] || (globalThis.RR_DEEP_TEXT_TRANSLATIONS[locale] = {}), phrases);

