  "es": {"Add picture…": "Añadir imagen…", "This model has no other textures yet. Add a picture to use instead of its own.": "Este modelo aún no tiene otras texturas. Añade una imagen para usarla en lugar de la suya."},
  "zh-Hant": {"Add picture…": "新增圖片…", "This model has no other textures yet. Add a picture to use instead of its own.": "此模型尚無其他貼圖。新增一張圖片來取代它原本的貼圖。"},
  "zh-Hans": {"Add picture…": "添加图片…", "This model has no other textures yet. Add a picture to use instead of its own.": "此模型还没有其他贴图。添加一张图片来代替它原本的贴图。"},
